WEBVTT

1
01:16:14.154 --> 01:16:18.714
Praise your name, praise the name of Jesus. Amen, amen.

2
01:16:18.754 --> 01:16:22.954
Go ahead and sit down, people. Hallelujah.

3
01:16:24.874 --> 01:16:28.794
Shayana, where are you actually? Where is Shayana?

4
01:16:30.074 --> 01:16:32.074
Where is Shayana?

5
01:16:33.754 --> 01:16:35.754
Shayana.

6
01:16:35.794 --> 01:16:42.914
SINGING AND MUSIC

7
01:16:44.714 --> 01:16:51.314
SINGING AND MUSIC

8
01:16:52.994 --> 01:16:55.754
Congratulations. How old have you turned?

9
01:16:55.794 --> 01:16:57.674
18.

10
01:16:57.714 --> 01:17:01.394
That's quite a treat. Where is Elias actually?

11
01:17:01.434 --> 01:17:03.794
Elias, stand up.

12
01:17:03.834 --> 01:17:10.834
SINGING AND MUSIC

13
01:17:14.114 --> 01:17:21.314
SINGING AND MUSIC

14
01:17:21.354 --> 01:17:24.354
Elias, how old have you turned? 18.

15
01:17:24.394 --> 01:17:27.874
Oh, you can exchange numbers, that's nice.

16
01:17:27.914 --> 01:17:31.114
I'm just saying, man. I don't know, man.

17
01:17:31.154 --> 01:17:32.674
SHOUTING

18
01:17:32.714 --> 01:17:35.994
Rijschot. I'm joking, Shayana.

19
01:17:36.034 --> 01:17:40.554
It's part of my ministry. I connect people, I just enjoy that.

20
01:17:40.554 --> 01:17:43.834
People find it so annoying when I always do that.

21
01:17:43.874 --> 01:17:46.714
And I'm not stopping, haha. It's really fun.

22
01:17:46.754 --> 01:17:49.514
One last question before we continue with the service.

23
01:17:49.554 --> 01:17:51.554
Oh, it's already a quarter to twelve, sorry.

24
01:17:51.594 --> 01:17:54.594
May I ask for a moment, those who have helped,

25
01:17:54.634 --> 01:17:58.274
in any capacity, if you helped during the children's camp,

26
01:17:58.314 --> 01:18:04.114
the youth camp, the set-up or the pack-down, or if you were there or you prayed this week,

27
01:18:04.154 --> 01:18:07.674
please stand up for a moment, because we want to applaud you.

28
01:18:07.714 --> 01:18:09.834
Go ahead and stand up, everyone.

29
01:18:09.874 --> 01:18:13.954
Thank you all, thank you all, thank you all, thank you all.

30
01:18:13.994 --> 01:18:16.194
CHEERING AND APPLAUSE

31
01:18:16.234 --> 01:18:19.754
Exactly, exactly. Thank you all.

32
01:18:19.794 --> 01:18:21.314
CHEERING AND APPLAUSE

33
01:18:21.354 --> 01:18:24.754
Hallelujah, thank you all. Thank you all, really.

34
01:18:24.794 --> 01:18:29.314
It's been such a wonderful camp. And God is good.

35
01:18:29.354 --> 01:18:35.274
And your investment here, and I say this every time, it seems like a cliché,

36
01:18:35.314 --> 01:18:38.474
but a cliché is only a cliché because it's true.

37
01:18:38.514 --> 01:18:43.354
It seems like a cliché when I keep saying that everything you do,

38
01:18:43.394 --> 01:18:48.274
every seed you sow in a youth camp has eternal value.

39
01:18:48.314 --> 01:18:50.354
And I mean that seriously.

40
01:18:50.394 --> 01:18:58.234
Someone said to me this week, Bram Els, Stefan has flown out,

41
01:18:58.274 --> 01:19:02.754
who follows his calling, Stefan was once one of those youth leaders

42
01:19:02.794 --> 01:19:07.914
who was able to train the young men in faith in open church,

43
01:19:07.914 --> 01:19:10.314
to disciple them in Christ.

44
01:19:10.354 --> 01:19:16.314
And that person said to me, yes, this is the first year that Stefan is not here.

45
01:19:16.354 --> 01:19:22.194
And that was intense, because he was always the one who could disciple us

46
01:19:22.234 --> 01:19:27.154
and guide us in purity and in faith in Jesus and dedication.

47
01:19:27.194 --> 01:19:29.794
And do you know what my response was to that person?

48
01:19:29.834 --> 01:19:32.114
Because that person might not have even realized it themselves.

49
01:19:32.154 --> 01:19:37.874
I said, yes, but what Stefan was, you are now. Right?

50
01:19:37.914 --> 01:19:41.274
And that is not an exaggeration about that person.

51
01:19:41.314 --> 01:19:45.954
So what Stefan Riemens was as a youth leader was to provide an influence of trust,

52
01:19:45.994 --> 01:19:48.434
an influence of dedication to Jesus,

53
01:19:48.474 --> 01:19:51.314
an influence of freedom to young boys

54
01:19:51.354 --> 01:19:54.234
over all the issues of young boys, let's now go there.

55
01:19:54.274 --> 01:19:58.074
But Stefan could really exert that influence completely.

56
01:19:58.114 --> 01:20:02.074
And because of that, because I say every time, eternal value,

57
01:20:02.114 --> 01:20:05.594
we create a next generation.

58
01:20:05.594 --> 01:20:09.714
And that next generation, I love you guys, I love you.

59
01:20:09.754 --> 01:20:12.234
When I look that there is a next generation

60
01:20:12.274 --> 01:20:16.274
that is now again discipling children and young teenagers.

61
01:20:16.314 --> 01:20:20.714
And it is a timeline of time and it goes through it

62
01:20:20.754 --> 01:20:22.914
and you don't even notice it about yourself.

63
01:20:22.954 --> 01:20:25.834
But if you go with the flow of Jesus and I,

64
01:20:25.874 --> 01:20:27.954
you will disciple people yourself.

65
01:20:27.994 --> 01:20:30.634
For apple trees bear apple trees. Amen?

66
01:20:30.674 --> 01:20:32.314
You know that concept, right?

67
01:20:32.314 --> 01:20:35.154
Praise God, let's continue with this.

68
01:20:35.194 --> 01:20:38.354
Let's continue with this, for it is good. Amen?

69
01:20:38.394 --> 01:20:39.394
Ruben?

70
01:20:41.234 --> 01:20:44.234
Really, this service lasts until three o'clock. I can see it already.

71
01:20:45.474 --> 01:20:48.274
Oh, then I still have some time to explain it.

72
01:20:48.314 --> 01:20:51.114
Okay, I may say something about giving.

73
01:20:51.154 --> 01:20:55.234
And I want to start by reading the text I had today.

74
01:20:56.674 --> 01:20:58.154
From 1 Timothy.

75
01:20:58.194 --> 01:21:02.194
And we have already read a lot in there over the past weeks.

76
01:21:02.194 --> 01:21:03.874
I will read it.

77
01:21:32.714 --> 01:21:37.794
...that we are generous and share much of our wealth.

78
01:21:37.834 --> 01:21:40.634
And I do think we know, when we read the Bible,

79
01:21:40.674 --> 01:21:43.754
that there are actually two types of blessings,

80
01:21:43.794 --> 01:21:46.314
two types of riches that appear in the Bible.

81
01:21:46.354 --> 01:21:50.674
And that is material wealth and spiritual wealth.

82
01:21:50.714 --> 01:21:54.194
And that spiritual wealth, we have just seen.

83
01:21:55.874 --> 01:21:58.834
That is what God is really all about.

84
01:21:58.874 --> 01:22:01.434
And what happens here in these three verses,

85
01:22:01.434 --> 01:22:07.714
is that material wealth is linked to spiritual wealth.

86
01:22:07.754 --> 01:22:11.794
For when we sow in His kingdom, with our finances,

87
01:22:11.834 --> 01:22:14.714
with our giving,

88
01:22:14.754 --> 01:22:17.594
and not just a little bit, a tiny bit,

89
01:22:17.634 --> 01:22:19.314
I think they have been abolished by now,

90
01:22:19.354 --> 01:22:23.834
but generously, abundantly giving.

91
01:22:23.874 --> 01:22:26.714
And it is about the people who are rich.

92
01:22:26.754 --> 01:22:28.834
For that is how the verse began.

93
01:22:28.914 --> 01:22:33.034
Give. And what Tim just said about that generation that is coming now,

94
01:22:33.074 --> 01:22:35.994
the investment we have made as a church,

95
01:22:36.034 --> 01:22:40.314
in these children, in these teenagers, should not be underestimated.

96
01:22:40.354 --> 01:22:45.194
It is a complete army being prepared for God, do you know that?

97
01:22:45.234 --> 01:22:49.874
They will one day stand here, on this stage.

98
01:22:49.914 --> 01:22:53.594
And they will educate the next generation until Jesus returns.

99
01:22:53.634 --> 01:22:55.034
And we may give towards that.

100
01:22:55.074 --> 01:22:57.674
And give generously in the name of Jesus.

101
01:22:57.714 --> 01:22:59.994
Lord God, I want to thank You.

102
01:23:00.034 --> 01:23:04.274
Lord God, for if there is anything we can do, it is to pray.

103
01:23:04.314 --> 01:23:06.634
Praying until we fall down.

104
01:23:06.674 --> 01:23:10.234
Lord God, to proclaim in the heavenly realms

105
01:23:10.274 --> 01:23:15.394
that the kingdom of Jesus is established in this place.

106
01:23:15.434 --> 01:23:18.474
Lord God, and that we prepare people here.

107
01:23:18.514 --> 01:23:22.514
Lord God, who will be pioneers and intercessors

108
01:23:22.554 --> 01:23:24.794
to expand Your kingdom.

109
01:23:24.794 --> 01:23:28.474
Lord God, and we want to make and organize this church in this way.

110
01:23:28.514 --> 01:23:30.794
Lord God, led by Your Holy Spirit.

111
01:23:30.834 --> 01:23:34.714
Lord God, so that we will be generous in our finances.

112
01:23:34.754 --> 01:23:37.474
To give, to sow.

113
01:23:37.514 --> 01:23:40.994
Lord God, and we honor You for what You will bring forth.

114
01:23:41.034 --> 01:23:45.034
Lord God, for it will never be our own work, but it will be Your work.

115
01:23:45.074 --> 01:23:49.674
Your Holy Spirit, Your power and Your love working through us, Lord.

116
01:23:49.714 --> 01:23:53.274
Lord God, and I want to thank You for the beautiful people, Lord God,

117
01:23:53.274 --> 01:23:57.674
that I have seen last week, who have put their shoulders to the wheel.

118
01:23:57.714 --> 01:24:00.914
The children with such a pure and clean heart.

119
01:24:00.954 --> 01:24:04.474
The young children, the teenagers, Lord God, who want to go for You.

120
01:24:04.514 --> 01:24:08.514
It is grace. It is wonderful, Lord God, to be able to see that.

121
01:24:08.554 --> 01:24:12.434
In Jesus' wonderful name. Amen. Amen.

122
01:24:13.434 --> 01:24:15.434
Amen.

123
01:24:15.474 --> 01:24:18.474
Wow. Amen.

124
01:24:18.514 --> 01:24:21.514
Thank you, Lord. Thank you for your presence.

125
01:24:21.554 --> 01:24:23.554
Thank you for your presence.

126
01:24:23.594 --> 01:24:26.594
Lord God, we recognize your work.

127
01:24:26.634 --> 01:24:29.634
Lord God, we recognize your work.

128
01:24:29.674 --> 01:24:31.674
And we celebrate you.

129
01:24:31.714 --> 01:24:34.714
That you lead us to the truth.

130
01:24:34.754 --> 01:24:37.754
That you lead us to the truth.

131
01:24:37.794 --> 01:24:39.794
And we celebrate you.

132
01:24:39.834 --> 01:24:42.834
That you lead us to the truth.

133
01:24:42.874 --> 01:24:45.874
And in true freedom.

134
01:24:45.914 --> 01:24:48.914
So, Lord, keep doing what you are doing.

135
01:24:48.954 --> 01:24:51.954
So, Lord, keep doing what you are doing.

136
01:24:51.994 --> 01:24:54.994
We honor you and we love your Word.

137
01:24:55.034 --> 01:24:57.034
Amen. Amen.

138
01:24:57.074 --> 01:24:59.074
Amen.

139
01:24:59.114 --> 01:25:02.114
Well, I receive the Word this morning.

140
01:25:02.154 --> 01:25:05.154
I may not bring it this morning.

141
01:25:05.554 --> 01:25:12.554
We recognized the power of intention at the camp.

142
01:25:12.594 --> 01:25:16.594
And we truly recognized the power of prayer at the camp.

143
01:25:16.634 --> 01:25:19.634
And I don't mean just at the camp.

144
01:25:19.674 --> 01:25:27.674
I mean, we recognized the collective years of intercession and intention...

145
01:25:27.714 --> 01:25:32.714
...that it has brought about a certain measure of freedom.

146
01:25:33.714 --> 01:25:38.714
We really noticed that the accumulated prayer of the past years...

147
01:25:38.754 --> 01:25:41.754
...has given a certain degree of freedom.

148
01:25:41.794 --> 01:25:45.794
Even freedom in worship.

149
01:25:45.834 --> 01:25:47.834
Really, we just saw it.

150
01:25:47.874 --> 01:25:53.874
There was so much peace to enter in, from the moment, in the presentation of the Lord.

151
01:25:53.914 --> 01:25:54.914
We really saw it.

152
01:25:54.954 --> 01:25:59.954
It was so easy to enter into that presence of God from the start.

153
01:25:59.994 --> 01:26:01.994
And that is prayer.

154
01:26:02.314 --> 01:26:06.314
Prayer that fully supports the workings of the ministry.

155
01:26:06.354 --> 01:26:12.354
The prayer that the Lord then uses to pour out His spirit at certain moments.

156
01:26:18.394 --> 01:26:22.394
So all that to say, thank you for the prayers.

157
01:26:25.434 --> 01:26:29.434
And thank you for the people who also prayed during the camp.

158
01:26:29.834 --> 01:26:32.834
And thank you for those who prayed during the camp.

159
01:26:32.874 --> 01:26:36.874
It was really tangible.

160
01:26:42.434 --> 01:26:44.434
And I am looking forward to Mondays again.

161
01:26:44.474 --> 01:26:48.474
And the Mondays don't start tomorrow, but from the first week of September.

162
01:26:50.634 --> 01:26:52.634
Thank you, Ben.

163
01:26:55.154 --> 01:26:58.154
They have given their time and energy.

164
01:26:59.714 --> 01:27:01.714
Crazy people.

165
01:27:02.234 --> 01:27:03.234
But that was the camp.

166
01:27:03.274 --> 01:27:05.274
Call me crazy, I follow Jesus.

167
01:27:05.314 --> 01:27:06.994
So you are crazy.

168
01:27:07.034 --> 01:27:10.034
You just have kids and then sat with the boys.

169
01:27:10.074 --> 01:27:11.274
It just kept going and going.

170
01:27:11.314 --> 01:27:13.314
Kids camp, boys camp, they kept going.

171
01:27:13.354 --> 01:27:14.154
Call me crazy.

172
01:27:14.194 --> 01:27:14.594
Amen.

173
01:27:14.634 --> 01:27:17.274
Okay, Matthew 22.

174
01:27:17.314 --> 01:27:18.314
We're going there.

175
01:27:18.354 --> 01:27:20.474
We're going to Matthew 22.

176
01:27:20.514 --> 01:27:23.514
I'm just going to outline what the camps were.

177
01:27:23.554 --> 01:27:26.474
And I want to give a summary of what the camps were about.

178
01:27:26.554 --> 01:27:33.554
And Vanya chose the biggest assignment.

179
01:27:38.034 --> 01:27:41.034
To ban the children's camp.

180
01:27:46.314 --> 01:27:51.314
And this is where Jesus is asked by the Pharisees.

181
01:27:51.674 --> 01:27:53.354
They want to test him.

182
01:27:54.354 --> 01:27:57.354
And this is where the Pharisees are testing Jesus.

183
01:27:57.394 --> 01:28:00.394
And they ask, what is the greatest thing we must do?

184
01:28:04.354 --> 01:28:07.354
Teacher, what is the greatest commandment in the law?

185
01:28:09.354 --> 01:28:11.354
And Jesus answered.

186
01:28:12.354 --> 01:28:15.354
You shall love the Lord your God with all your heart.

187
01:28:16.354 --> 01:28:18.354
And with all your soul.

188
01:28:19.354 --> 01:28:21.354
And with all your mind.

189
01:28:21.354 --> 01:28:24.354
And another version says, and with all your strength.

190
01:28:29.354 --> 01:28:32.354
And then He says, this is the greatest and the first commandment.

191
01:28:32.354 --> 01:28:37.354
And by first, it is not meant that this is what you focus on for the first ten minutes of your day.

192
01:28:37.354 --> 01:28:39.354
And then you just go about your own way.

193
01:28:39.354 --> 01:28:43.354
But by first, it means this is the all-encompassing command.

194
01:28:48.354 --> 01:28:51.354
And then He says, this is the greatest and the first commandment.

195
01:28:51.354 --> 01:28:54.354
And by first, it is not meant that this is what you focus on for the first ten minutes of your day.

196
01:28:54.354 --> 01:28:57.354
And then you just go about your own way.

197
01:28:57.354 --> 01:29:01.354
But by first, it means this is the all-encompassing command.

198
01:29:07.354 --> 01:29:13.354
It is the first and it is intended that this truly consumes the whole life of a disciple.

199
01:29:16.354 --> 01:29:18.354
And it is the greatest in the whole kingdom.

200
01:29:21.354 --> 01:29:24.354
And then He says, faith, hope, and love, but the greatest is...

201
01:29:25.354 --> 01:29:29.354
Paul says that also in Corinth, there remain faith, hope, and love.

202
01:29:29.354 --> 01:29:31.354
And the greatest of these is love.

203
01:29:38.354 --> 01:29:43.354
Love is everything that matters in the eternal kingdom. That love will never fade.

204
01:29:47.354 --> 01:29:50.354
We make it complicated, but Jesus made it very simple.

205
01:29:51.354 --> 01:29:55.354
We made it complicated by making a whole lot of things and doing a whole lot of things.

206
01:29:55.354 --> 01:30:00.354
But He said, the greatest thing you need to focus on is the love of the Lord, your God.

207
01:30:08.354 --> 01:30:10.354
Now again, that sounds abstract.

208
01:30:10.354 --> 01:30:13.354
One of the young people asked me in his free time,

209
01:30:13.354 --> 01:30:16.354
what does it mean when the Bible says, love of the Lord with all your heart?

210
01:30:16.354 --> 01:30:18.354
What is that? What does that mean?

211
01:30:22.354 --> 01:30:25.354
What does it actually mean to love the Lord with my whole heart?

212
01:30:31.354 --> 01:30:35.354
And it was wonderful, because we were sitting with a group of girls and we were talking about the Bible.

213
01:30:35.354 --> 01:30:40.354
And I said, in Hebrew, heart really means your whole being.

214
01:30:40.354 --> 01:30:43.354
When you love someone, what does that mean with your heart? What does that mean?

215
01:30:43.354 --> 01:30:48.354
Indeed, it means with all your person, all your being. Amen?

216
01:30:55.354 --> 01:31:03.354
And the more I study scriptures, the more I see the repetition of the love of the Lord as the first and the only thing.

217
01:31:05.354 --> 01:31:09.354
The more I study the Bible, the more I see that repetition coming back,

218
01:31:09.354 --> 01:31:13.354
that the first and foremost is to love the Lord and God.

219
01:31:17.354 --> 01:31:21.354
And it is not abstract. He means what He says.

220
01:31:26.354 --> 01:31:31.354
But we struggle and wrestle with that to give ourselves completely.

221
01:31:35.354 --> 01:31:42.354
And then David wrote in Psalm 27, there is one thing that I desire, one thing that I seek and that is to my Lord,

222
01:31:42.354 --> 01:31:47.354
to keep my gaze fixed on the Lord and to be in His temple all the days of my life.

223
01:31:48.354 --> 01:31:54.354
What is happening here is that He aligns His whole life with that first and greatest commandment.

224
01:32:02.354 --> 01:32:07.354
And again, if you want to know what love means, because the world today is love-generative,

225
01:32:07.354 --> 01:32:10.354
because the world today is love-generative,

226
01:32:10.354 --> 01:32:13.354
because the world today is love-generative,

227
01:32:13.354 --> 01:32:18.354
and if you want to know what love means, because today in the world love equals tolerance,

228
01:32:24.354 --> 01:32:33.354
and Tim has been talking about that all month, we are not the same as the world, we are not equal to the culture in which we find ourselves.

229
01:32:34.354 --> 01:32:40.354
When you come through those gates on Sunday, be washed in the Word before you enter.

230
01:32:51.354 --> 01:32:57.354
And when you come through those gates on Sunday, be washed in the Word before you enter.

231
01:33:04.354 --> 01:33:10.354
And it would be even better to turn off other things to fully focus on that first commandment,

232
01:33:10.354 --> 01:33:14.354
and that is to love the Lord your God with your mind.

233
01:33:21.354 --> 01:33:27.354
And when Jesus says, love Him with your heart, with your soul, and with your mind, He means what He says.

234
01:33:34.354 --> 01:33:40.354
And people struggle with this and then say, does that really mean I have to spend more time in the Word? Yes.

235
01:33:53.354 --> 01:33:55.354
There is no other way.

236
01:33:55.354 --> 01:34:00.354
And we complicate it by thinking, surely there must be an easier way?

237
01:34:14.354 --> 01:34:19.354
But there is only one way and it says it is a narrow way and that means you have to cast things aside,

238
01:34:19.354 --> 01:34:22.354
but it is one way and you follow it into eternity.

239
01:34:25.354 --> 01:34:31.354
So after 18 years in the Lord, after 18 years in the study of the Word of God,

240
01:34:31.354 --> 01:34:38.354
more and more as I warn Him in my heart and my soul,

241
01:34:38.354 --> 01:34:43.354
then I feel things that I have read, that is my feeling.

